# Krenko's Buzzcrusher has flying and trample. It enters with no nonbasic land in play (nothing is asked). On Bot1's next
# turn Bot2's Woodland Changeling cannot block it (flying), and Bot2's 1/1 flying Healer's Hawk can: the Buzzcrusher assigns 1
# damage to the Hawk and tramples the other 3 over to Bot2 (20 - 3 = 17, +1 for the Hawk's lifelink damage = 18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby x4
Krenko's Buzzcrusher
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Woodland Changeling
Healer's Hawk
Island x2
Island x10

[Actions]
