Bot2.Hand.Healer's Hawk.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Krenko's Buzzcrusher > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Woodland Changeling > Krenko's Buzzcrusher)
Bot2.Block(Healer's Hawk > Krenko's Buzzcrusher)
